# Umbrella root. Each app under apps/ has its own .gitignore for its own
# build artifacts (deps/, _build/, etc.) — this file only covers things
# that could ever land at the umbrella root itself. Root mix.exs declares
# `deps: []` deliberately (see its moduledoc) — always run mix commands
# from inside apps/<name>, never from here, or Mix's umbrella-wide combined
# dependency resolution pulls in every child's deps at the root and the
# apps collide trying to start together in one BEAM node.
/_build/
/deps/
/mix.lock
erl_crash.dump
.elixir_ls/
